  "details": "1,Launch the world:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_ccc409d2-537f-4aaa-8d11-fd03876a732c/info\n\n2,Gather 60 or more players in a single instance.\n\n3,Wait for several minutes of normal activity or move around the map.\n\n4,Suddenly, jump input stops responding for many or all players.\n\n5,Affected players’ avatars continue walking in the last input direction and cannot stop.\n\n6,Voice chat (& iwasync) continues functioning normally.\n\n7,The issue does not occur with fewer than ~10 players, even when avatars are high-performance-cost.\n\n8,The world includes multiple Udon systems such as PlayerSelector, YodoHapticSwitch, and Cinemachine camera.\n\nThis issue has been continuously observed since August 23, 2025.",
